# APIのビルドに必要な入力だけをDockerへ渡す。
**
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!apps/
apps/**
!apps/api/
apps/api/**
!apps/api/package.json
!apps/api/tsconfig.json
!apps/api/src/
!apps/api/src/**
!apps/api/prisma/
!apps/api/prisma/**
!packages/
packages/**
!packages/shared/
packages/shared/**
!packages/shared/package.json
!packages/shared/tsconfig.json
!packages/shared/src/
!packages/shared/src/**
# 許可したソース配下でもローカルの秘密ファイルを渡さない。
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.harness
**/tests
